==English==
{{was wotd|2013|January|1}}
{{was wotd|2014|January|1}}

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|la|en}} ''inception-'', stem of {{m|la|inceptiō}}, from {{term|inceptus|lang=la}}, Perfect passive participle of {{m|la|incipiō||I begin}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ɪnˈsɛpʃən/|lang=en}}
* {{audio|En-us-inception.ogg|Audio (US)|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|ɛpʃən|lang=en}}
* {{hyphenation|in|cep|tion|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# The [[creation]] or [[beginning]] of something; the [[establishment]].
#: ''From its '''inception''' the agency has been helping people obtain and properly install car seats for children.''

====Coordinate terms====
* [[conception]]

====Derived terms====
* [[-ception]]

